  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Academic capacity in physiotherapy education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to strengthen the academic capacity in physiotherapy education and research in Nepal as prerequisite to develop physiotherapy as an integral part in the health service system. The rationale is the lack of qualified work force to staff basic training programs to satisfy the need of physiotherapists in the health sector and the lack of post graduate opportunities to qualify for entry to PhD programs and research.</narrative>
  </description>
